## After VELA work

Default: always run `@gce-stop` after `@gce-run` or `@gce-jupyter` unless the user explicitly asks to keep the VM running.

Optional downsize (CPU-only default shape):

```sh
scripts/gce_vela/remote.sh downsize
```

